  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="a9e6da63-f3aa-5aa6-86e8-efd1198ef5ca" activityNameId="6297060d-e720-5413-873f-cbccdb6423bf" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Fraction 7, from naphtha, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Fraction 7, from naphtha, at plant
The multioutput-process "naphta, to melecular sieve separations" delivers the co-products hexane, heptane, 2,3-dimethylbutane, 2-methylpentane, methylcyclopentane, 1,1-dimethylcyclopentane, methylcyclohexane, fraction 1 from naphta, fraction 7 from naphta, and fraction 8 from naphta. The allocation is based on mass balance.;
UUID: b2b5e4a2-cd50-33c1-9966-cd774cbf4665
Molecular sieve separation of naphta including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled with data from plants in the USA.
Technology: Separation of naphta with a zeolith 5a molecular sieve.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Some data are derived from other or unknown plants or have been estimated.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b2b5e4a2-cd50-33c1-9966-cd774cbf4665.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
